{"seq":2,"slug":"ldpc-codes","title":"LDPC 码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/modern-codes/ldpc-codes","wordCount":1695,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ldpc-码\">LDPC 码</h1><p>1962 年 Robert Gallager 在博士论文里提出了低密度奇偶校验码，但当时的硬件跑不动它的迭代译码，这个构造沉睡了三十多年。直到 1990 年代 Turbo 码引爆「迭代软译码能逼近香农极限」的认知，人们才重新发现 Gallager 的 LDPC 同样强大甚至更优。今天它是 5G 数据信道、Wi-Fi 6、以及几乎每一块现代 SSD 的纠错核心。LDPC 的精髓在于两点：校验矩阵极度稀疏，以及在这个稀疏结构上让节点反复交换「置信度」的消息传递译码。这一篇讲清稀疏为什么关键、Tanner 图如何组织译码、以及置信传播如何迭代收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LDPC 仍是线性分组码，由校验矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 定义，但它对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 提出一个反直觉的要求：<strong>极度稀疏</strong>——每行每列只有寥寥几个 1。稀疏是全部威力的源头：它让译码可以分解成局部的消息传递，复杂度只随码长线性增长，于是几万比特的长码变得可行，而长码正是逼近香农极限的前提。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 画成 <strong>Tanner 图</strong>（变量节点与校验节点的二部图）后，译码就是在这张图上反复交换置信度的 <strong>置信传播</strong>（和积算法），在 LLR 域上迭代收敛。图的结构——尤其是最短环（围长）——决定性能与错误平层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏校验矩阵\">稀疏校验矩阵</h2><p>LDPC 仍是<a href=\"../linear-codes/linear-block-codes\">线性分组码</a>，由校验矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 定义（码字满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H\\mathbf{c}^T=\\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），但它对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 提出一个反直觉的要求：<strong>极度稀疏</strong>——每行每列只有寥寥几个 1，绝大多数是 0。一个长度上万的码，每列可能只有 3~6 个 1。</p>\n<p>稀疏为什么关键？因为它让每个校验约束只牵涉少数几个比特，每个比特只参与少数几个校验。这意味着译码时的「消息」可以在一个稀疏连接的网络上局部传播，而不必求解稠密的全局方程。稀疏还保证了迭代译码的复杂度只随码长线性增长，使几万比特的长码在实践中可行——而长码正是逼近香农极限的前提。密度低到什么程度、连接如何设计（规则 vs 非规则），直接决定性能与错误平层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tanner-图-把码画成二部图\">Tanner 图：把码画成二部图</h2><p>理解 LDPC 译码的钥匙是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 画成 <strong>Tanner 图</strong>——一个二部图，一侧是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个<strong>变量节点</strong>（对应码字每一位），另一侧是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个<strong>校验节点</strong>（对应每一行校验约束）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{ij}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，就在校验节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 与变量节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 之间连一条边。稀疏的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 对应一张边很少的图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  V1[变量节点 c1] --- C1[校验节点 s1]&#10;  V2[变量节点 c2] --- C1&#10;  V3[变量节点 c3] --- C1&#10;  V2 --- C2[校验节点 s2]&#10;  V4[变量节点 c4] --- C2&#10;  V5[变量节点 c5] --- C2&#10;  V3 --- C3[校验节点 s3]&#10;  V5 --- C3&#10;  V6[变量节点 c6] --- C3\">graph TD\n  V1[变量节点 c1] --- C1[校验节点 s1]\n  V2[变量节点 c2] --- C1\n  V3[变量节点 c3] --- C1\n  V2 --- C2[校验节点 s2]\n  V4[变量节点 c4] --- C2\n  V5[变量节点 c5] --- C2\n  V3 --- C3[校验节点 s3]\n  V5 --- C3\n  V6[变量节点 c6] --- C3</pre><p>译码就在这张图上进行：每个变量节点根据信道观测形成初始置信，然后与相连的校验节点反复来回传递消息，逐步把弱证据汇聚成强判决。图的结构决定一切——特别是图中最短环的长度（<strong>围长</strong> girth）。短环会让消息在传递中「自我强化」造成相关，损害收敛，因此好的 LDPC 设计刻意避开长度为 4 的环、追求大围长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信传播-消息如何传递\">置信传播：消息如何传递</h2><p>LDPC 的标准译码是<strong>置信传播</strong>（belief propagation），也叫和积算法（sum-product）。它在对数似然比（LLR）域上工作，充分利用<a href=\"../foundations/channel-noise-model\">信道与噪声模型</a>提供的软信息。核心是两类消息的交替更新：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>变量到校验</strong>：变量节点把「除了这条边之外，所有其它证据加起来我认为自己是 0 还是 1」的 LLR 发给校验节点。相当于综合信道观测与其它校验的意见。</li>\n<li><strong>校验到变量</strong>：校验节点利用「相连比特异或应为 0」的约束，把「根据其它比特推断你应该是多少」的 LLR 发回变量节点。这一步涉及双曲正切运算：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tanh</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></munder><mi>tanh</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tanh\\!\\left(\\frac{L_{c\\to v}}{2}\\right) = \\prod_{v&#x27; \\neq v} \\tanh\\!\\left(\\frac{L_{v&#x27;\\to c}}{2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tanh</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"rlap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak mtight\"></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tanh</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.328em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两类消息交替迭代若干轮，每轮后变量节点汇总所有消息做硬判决，若满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H\\hat{\\mathbf{c}}^T=\\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 就提前停止。迭代通常在 10~50 轮内收敛。为降低硬件成本，工程上常用<strong>最小和</strong>（min-sum）近似替代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tanh</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tanh</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tanh</span></span></span></span></span> 乘积——把复杂的连乘换成取最小值再修正，几乎不损性能却大幅省算力，这是 5G 与 SSD 控制器的实际选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能-平层与设计权衡\">性能、平层与设计权衡</h2><p>LDPC 的误码率曲线有两段：先是陡峭下坠的<strong>瀑布区</strong>（离香农极限常不到 1 dB），随后可能出现下降变缓的<strong>错误平层</strong>（error floor）。平层由图中的小环结构和「陷阱集」引起，是长码设计的头号敌人，需靠优化度分布与消去短环来压低。</p>\n<p>下表把 LDPC 与本章其它码放在一起对比定位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>LDPC</th>\n<th>卷积码/Viterbi</th>\n<th>Reed-Solomon</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>稀疏二部图</td>\n<td>网格</td>\n<td>有限域多项式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>译码</td>\n<td>迭代置信传播</td>\n<td>动态规划（一次）</td>\n<td>代数（一次）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逼近容量</td>\n<td>极近（长码）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>远（非容量导向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>高（迭代+长码）</td>\n<td>低、固定</td>\n<td>低、固定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>擅长</td>\n<td>随机错误、软判决</td>\n<td>流式、低延迟</td>\n<td>突发错误、擦除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择 LDPC 意味着接受较高的译码延迟与复杂度，换取逼近极限的纠错力——这在吞吐优先的 5G 数据信道和寿命敏感的 SSD 上完全值得，见<a href=\"../practice/codes-in-comms\">通信中的编码</a>与<a href=\"../practice/codes-in-storage\">存储中的纠错</a>。据 3GPP TS 38.212，5G NR 用两个 LDPC 基图（base graph）配合速率匹配覆盖宽泛的码率与块长；面向 6G 的空间耦合 LDPC（SC-LDPC）等增强正在研究中（arxiv.org/abs/2410.16875）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LDPC 是校验矩阵极度稀疏的线性码，稀疏让迭代译码复杂度随码长线性增长，长码得以逼近容量。</li>\n<li>Tanner 图把码组织成变量节点与校验节点的二部图，围长（最短环）是关键设计量。</li>\n<li>置信传播在 LLR 域交替更新变量到校验、校验到变量的消息，迭代收敛；min-sum 是省算力的工程近似。</li>\n<li>性能有瀑布区与错误平层两段，平层由短环/陷阱集引起，需优化度分布压低。</li>\n<li>5G 数据信道、Wi-Fi 6、现代 SSD 广泛采用 LDPC，代价是较高译码延迟。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"convolutional-viterbi\">卷积码与 Viterbi 译码</a> —— 图上软信息传递范式的起点。</li>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"polar-codes\">极化码</a> —— 另一种逼近容量、被 5G 控制信道采用的构造。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../information-theory/information-measures/entropy\">熵</a> —— LLR 与信息度量的联系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LDPC 码","id":"ldpc-码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏校验矩阵","id":"稀疏校验矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"Tanner 图：把码画成二部图","id":"tanner-图-把码画成二部图"},{"level":2,"text":"置信传播：消息如何传递","id":"置信传播-消息如何传递"},{"level":2,"text":"性能、平层与设计权衡","id":"性能-平层与设计权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"卷积码与 Viterbi 译码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/modern-codes/convolutional-viterbi"},"next":{"title":"极化码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/modern-codes/polar-codes"}}